flowchart LR
  PR[Pull Request] --> MERGE[Merge main]
  MERGE --> F{paths}
  F -->|apps| BUILD[Build + push registry]
  F -->|k8s/**| APPLY[apply-k8s-manifests]
  BUILD --> ACA[deploy-azure ACA]
  BUILD --> ECS[deploy-aws ECS]
  BUILD --> AKS[deploy-aks set-image]
  BUILD --> EKS[deploy-eks set-image]
  APPLY --> AKS
  APPLY --> EKS
